<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
    <title>Interview Prep Tracker</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
</head>
<body>
<div class="landing">
    <div class="landing-nav">
        <a href="/" class="brand"><span class="brand-mark"></span>Prep Tracker</a>
        <div class="actions">
            <a href="/login" class="btn ghost">Log in</a>
            <a href="/register" class="btn">Create account</a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="landing-hero">
        <h1>Walk into every interview ready.</h1>
        <p>Schedule your interviews, tick off your prep, and practise with questions the AI writes from your resume, then checks your answers.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="landing-preview" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="m-row">
            <span class="c-date"><span class="d">12</span><span class="m">OCT</span></span>
            <span><strong>Google</strong> &middot; SDE Intern</span>
            <span class="pill scheduled">Scheduled</span>
        </div>
        <div class="m-row">
            <span class="c-date"><span class="d">03</span><span class="m">OCT</span></span>
            <span><strong>Atlassian</strong> &middot; Backend Developer</span>
            <span class="pill selected">Selected</span>
        </div>
        <div class="m-row">
            <span class="c-date"><span class="d">21</span><span class="m">SEP</span></span>
            <span><strong>Flipkart</strong> &middot; SDE-1</span>
            <span class="pill completed">Completed</span>
        </div>
    </div>

    <ul class="features">
        <li>
            <h4>Track every interview</h4>
            <p>Upcoming and completed, with your result on each.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
            <h4>Know your readiness</h4>
            <p>A checklist for resume, DSA, OOP, DBMS, SQL and HR rounds.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
            <h4>Practise for real</h4>
            <p>Answer resume-based questions and get scored feedback.</p>
        </li>
    </ul>
</div>
</body>
</html>
